<%# The brand: "$plit" with a gap cut through it. The cut is a band in the page
    colour drawn over the text in CSS (.wordmark-art::after), so on the black
    surface it reads as a break in the letters rather than a visible line.
    Live text keeps it in the app's font and lets nav and intro share one
    definition. It is hidden from screen readers; whatever holds it names the
    app. %>
<span class="wordmark-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>$</span>plit</span>
